// team from its own country. "winBonus" and "podiumBonus" are paid per car. The rest is what
// the product does to the car: "power" and "thirst" multiply horsepower and fuel use, "wear"
// multiplies tyre wear, "handling" is added, and "reliability" is added to the car's
// reliability. "minStanding" keeps the grand names away from small teams.
